<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 82.74 to 6855.80. For the week, the Dow rose 42.71 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.91 to 413.80, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.41.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1627 to 930.</p>
<p>Volume was 538,607,960 compared with 519,380,890 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,608,917,960 shares.</p>
